Selected Idea
-------------

Narrative is the recurrent failure point - target Narrative to preserve a company-first story
Across multiple experiments the first visible editorial hierarchy break most often appears in the Narrative stage: Narrative frequently reframes a company-first brief into a product/orchestration-first story or introduces unsupported audience/validation language. Use the Narrative stage as the controlled intervention point in the next trial to test whether preserving the companyproduct relationship at Narrative reduces downstream drift.

