3. Which specific Narrative prompt or input changes would be effective at preventing downstream reframing is UNKNOWN; the report recommends a controlled trial to test interventions. (Implication and trial recommendation)
4. Whether preserving a company-first selected Idea alone is sufficient to prevent downstream drift in general is UNKNOWN; the report records that Experiment 009 candidate Idea changes did not demonstrate improvement but does not generalize sufficiency. (Facts 23 and 24)
